WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.980
<b>Day 61</b>

00:03.790 --> 00:07.120
<i>It was the first time I had been hunting 
with Gobkichi in a while.</i>

00:09.450 --> 00:12.620
<i>We caught sight of 12 armed human soldiers.</i>

00:12.960 --> 00:15.580
Gobkichi, we're changing course! After them!

00:15.580 --> 00:16.620
Right!

00:16.620 --> 00:21.120
<i>We followed them, and found them 
hiding on the side of a road, concealed.</i>

00:21.630 --> 00:23.700
<i>A little bit of eavesdropping and...</i>

00:24.510 --> 00:29.130
<i>It turns out they're here to kidnap 
the daughter of the elvish chieftain.</i>

00:29.440 --> 00:32.260
<i>They're targeting her on the way 
home from some sort of festival.</i>

00:32.640 --> 00:37.640
<i>I also learned that someone among 
the elves had tipped them off.</i>

00:38.390 --> 00:40.640
<i>About two hours after sunset...</i>

00:44.480 --> 00:45.540
There.

00:49.460 --> 00:51.410
<i>So, that's the chief's daughter.</i>

00:52.080 --> 00:56.160
<i>Elves are generally pretty attractive 
all around, but she's a cut above.</i>

01:09.300 --> 01:11.470
Target confirmed! Attack!

01:10.040 --> 01:14.300
<i>Well, I'd feel kinda bad 
just abandoning her, so...</i>

01:22.370 --> 01:24.310
Gobkichi, aren't they heavy?

01:24.760 --> 01:26.690
Not even a little!

01:28.220 --> 01:31.530
We'll have to pray the others rest in peace.

03:07.460 --> 03:11.460
<b>Day 62</b>

03:08.060 --> 03:11.460
<i>So, regarding the 12 humans 
we took prisoner...</i>

03:11.460 --> 03:13.470
Okay, I'll talk!

03:12.460 --> 03:16.470
<i>It seems that the human army will 
make their move within 20 days.</i>

03:13.470 --> 03:16.470
I'll talk, so don't kill me!

03:18.550 --> 03:22.830
<i>I took the abilities from all 12 of them, 
and didn't leave any leftovers.</i>

03:18.800 --> 03:21.020
<i>Secret Force, Vorpal Punisher, Hermit, 
Skill Ray, Contribute, Unlock, Release Trap,</i>

03:21.020 --> 03:23.230
<i>Sense Trap, Sense Enemy, Improved Assassination, Hidden Weapon Mastery, Humanbane,</i>

03:23.230 --> 03:25.460
<i>Vorpal Strike, Aura Slash, Back Attack, Needleshot, Throw, Severe Pain Resistance,</i>

03:25.460 --> 03:26.600
<i>Charm Resistance, Assassination Resistance.</i>

03:32.610 --> 03:34.440
Finally awake, huh?

03:38.030 --> 03:42.030
Those wings... The other elves 
don't have anything like those.

03:42.030 --> 03:44.500
Wh-Where in the world am I?

03:44.500 --> 03:47.370
What happened to my guards? Did they—

03:47.370 --> 03:48.620
Settle down.

03:48.970 --> 03:51.670
Are you going to rob me of my chastity?!

03:51.670 --> 03:53.590
I don't even wanna dignify 
that with a response.

03:54.000 --> 03:56.070
Forgive me for losing my composure.

03:56.070 --> 03:59.260
<i>When the timing was right, 
I told her how things had gone down.</i>

03:56.380 --> 03:59.260
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 43 0 43

03:56.380 --> 03:59.260
<b>I've prepared
[Special Medicinal Tea]
which has a calming effect</b>

04:00.450 --> 04:04.770
That's terrible! 
Couldn't you have saved the others?

04:04.770 --> 04:09.430
Keeping quiet and just letting it play out... 
How could you do something so awful?!

04:05.770 --> 04:08.980
<i>That's a fair response, I guess.</i>

04:09.430 --> 04:12.270
You are so, so mean!

04:14.500 --> 04:20.410
Listen, this beef between you and 
the humans is none of our business.

04:20.830 --> 04:24.520
Besides, there's a traitor among your people.

04:25.910 --> 04:28.170
If you've got time to freak out,

04:28.170 --> 04:31.650
maybe you should worry 
about dealing with that instead.

04:39.470 --> 04:43.790
Rest up for today. 
I'll send you home tomorrow.

04:44.660 --> 04:48.930
Now, what's this I hear 
about a fine piece of elf?

04:48.930 --> 04:51.210
Can I get a taste?

04:51.210 --> 04:53.400
Hell no, you can't!

04:53.940 --> 04:56.940
You're no fun at all!

04:57.440 --> 05:02.450
<b>Day 63</b>

04:58.910 --> 05:02.450
<i>Today, we left the village to see her home.</i>

05:03.590 --> 05:07.780
So, what's up with those wings 
that were coming out of your back?

05:08.450 --> 05:13.630
Those... are something only high elves have.

05:13.630 --> 05:16.960
We normally hide them inside of our bodies.

05:16.960 --> 05:22.370
<i>High elves are what happen when elves 
rank up, and the wings allow them to fly.</i>

05:22.370 --> 05:24.930
They're usually not meant 
to be shown to others,

05:24.930 --> 05:28.970
but because I'm still so inexperienced, 
they pop out sometimes...

05:29.320 --> 05:32.480
<i>And so, after three hours of walking,</i>

05:33.050 --> 05:35.980
<i>we arrived at the elf village, but...</i>

05:40.960 --> 05:45.570
<i>Over 25 of them, with mythril arrowheads.</i>

05:45.570 --> 05:48.990
<i>Ogres like us should be able to 
survive a couple dozen shots.</i>

05:48.990 --> 05:53.000
Please wait! They saved my life!

05:57.890 --> 06:02.510
<i>It was touch-and-go for a while, 
but we were allowed to enter the village.</i>

06:03.760 --> 06:05.010
Father!

06:05.410 --> 06:07.730
Forgive me for worrying you.

06:07.730 --> 06:11.920
You needn't apologize. 
I'm glad to see you've returned safely.

06:11.920 --> 06:15.980
You have my deepest gratitude 
for saving my daughter.

06:16.630 --> 06:19.020
I am the chief of this village.

06:19.720 --> 06:22.010
So, getting right to business...

06:22.670 --> 06:26.180
I didn't rescue your girl 
purely out of good will.

06:27.370 --> 06:28.860
A reward, then?

06:29.470 --> 06:31.320
Hey. Bring it here.

06:31.320 --> 06:32.540
Very good, sir.

06:33.080 --> 06:36.090
<i>I'm letting him display 
what his kid means to him.</i>

06:36.090 --> 06:40.550
<i>It'll be a good chance to get 
a grasp on his judgment.</i>

06:41.710 --> 06:43.360
This is the Failnot.

06:42.800 --> 06:48.550
m 0 0 l 106 0 106 30 0 30

06:42.800 --> 06:48.550
<b>Bow of Absolute Accuracy
[Relic of Lost Gods]
[Ancient] Class</b>

06:43.360 --> 06:46.570
A family treasure of ours, and a magical item.

06:46.980 --> 06:48.550
Father?!

06:48.550 --> 06:52.980
You've returned to me in one piece. 
That is worth nothing less.

06:54.450 --> 06:57.150
I apologize for testing you.

06:57.150 --> 07:02.570
To make up for it, I have some information 
that you'll likely find useful.

07:04.240 --> 07:06.070
And what is that?

07:07.240 --> 07:09.580
The movements of the 
human army, for instance.

07:10.280 --> 07:13.430
I believe we will be fast friends.

07:13.430 --> 07:17.610
<i>The elven father gave us 
a ton of mythril equipment.</i>

07:17.610 --> 07:22.640
<i>In return, I provided him with 
spirit stone knives and magical item shovels,</i>

07:22.640 --> 07:24.470
<i>sealing our deal.</i>

07:24.990 --> 07:28.470
I hope you don't mind me asking,

07:29.740 --> 07:33.940
but a group of our elite fighters 
has been missing for nearly 20 days...

07:35.130 --> 07:36.940
Have you heard anything?

07:36.940 --> 07:39.040
Nah, sure haven't!

07:40.730 --> 07:44.300
<i>On the way back, they even 
had going-away presents for us.</i>

07:44.300 --> 07:47.140
These are medicines and 
fine liquor made in our village.

07:47.140 --> 07:49.000
I hope you'll enjoy them.

07:49.000 --> 07:52.990
If you need help, give us a call! 
You get the friend discount!

07:53.850 --> 07:55.500
Damn, that's good!

07:55.500 --> 07:58.780
How is the flavor so rich but so crisp?!

07:58.780 --> 08:02.180
<i>That's another reason to get along 
with the elf chieftain.</i>

08:05.010 --> 08:08.010
<b>Day 64</b>

08:08.350 --> 08:12.900
Hey, Gobmi... it's morning. Rise and shine.

08:16.780 --> 08:21.150
<i>She had ranked up into a
 dhampir variant during the night.</i>

08:21.920 --> 08:25.610
<i>Not just her, either. 
We've got eight new hobgoblins.</i>

08:26.030 --> 08:30.030
Don't take those glasses off 
unless it's around an enemy, Gobmi.

08:31.020 --> 08:33.030
Right, I know.

08:33.030 --> 08:37.090
<i>According to her, a blessing from the God of Ice</i>

08:36.040 --> 08:43.040
<b>[Mist Dress of
the Undead Queen]

Magic Sword:
[Drops of Moonlight]

[Glasses of
Evil Eye Sealing]</b>

08:37.090 --> 08:38.860
<i>has given her the ability to create</i>

08:38.860 --> 08:40.310
<i>and manipulate large amounts of ice.</i>

08:40.840 --> 08:42.430
<i>Her evil eyes ability</i>

08:42.430 --> 08:45.370
<i>can charm enemies into fighting amongst themselves,</i>

08:45.370 --> 08:49.550
<i>and the usual weakness she'd have to sunlight 
is offset by the blessing she's received.</i>

08:50.580 --> 08:51.550
<i>Although...</i>

08:52.980 --> 08:58.000
<i>Her appearance... is familiar 
to me, for some reason.</i>

08:58.000 --> 08:59.310
Is something wrong?

08:59.310 --> 09:01.390
Nah. Just amazed by how you look.

09:01.390 --> 09:02.950
Oh, you!

09:03.610 --> 09:05.320
Here I am!

09:05.320 --> 09:08.820
<i>Gobe had evolved into a half-earth lord.</i>

09:05.320 --> 09:08.820
<b>[War Pick of Mother Earth] [Shovel of Mother Earth]
Her work clothes are also a magical item.</b>

09:09.330 --> 09:12.320
<i>Earth lords have the ability 
to manipulate the ground.</i>

09:12.320 --> 09:15.290
<i>She can pinpoint weak points in
 bedrock with geological assessment...</i>

09:15.290 --> 09:16.980
<i>as well as an ability to
 make her body stronger,</i>

09:16.980 --> 09:20.460
<i>and lightning magic for detecting gems.</i>

09:20.460 --> 09:22.880
Get a load of me, Sei!

09:22.460 --> 09:26.340
<b>Magic Sword: [Bloody Empress]
Her armor and cape are also magical items.</b>

09:22.880 --> 09:26.340
<i>And Hobsato had evolved into a half-bloody lord.</i>

09:27.090 --> 09:31.840
<i>Their distinguishing feature is being able to 
control blood and make it into weapons.</i>

09:33.010 --> 09:34.850
<i>I have to wonder, though...</i>

09:35.520 --> 09:37.640
<i>The locations and shapes are all different,</i>

09:37.640 --> 09:40.060
<i>but they've all got tattoos similar to mine.</i>

09:40.060 --> 09:44.860
<i>They say the tattoos seem to give them power, 
so I hope to figure that out, in time.</i>

09:45.380 --> 09:48.580
Have you all evolved again?!

09:48.580 --> 09:53.360
Looks like you'll be 
needing new names, then!

09:53.360 --> 09:56.470
Hobsei will be Spellsei, 
Gobmi will be Dhami,

09:53.360 --> 09:56.610
<b>Hobsei is now [Spellsei]</b>

09:53.360 --> 09:58.860
<b>Hobsato is now [Bloodsato]</b>

09:53.360 --> 09:59.870
<b>Gobmi is now [Dhami]</b>

09:56.070 --> 09:59.870
<b>Gobe is now [Earthe]</b>

09:56.470 --> 09:59.870
Hobsato is now Bloodsato, 
and Gobe is now Earthe.

09:57.570 --> 09:58.710
Yeah!

09:59.870 --> 10:02.620
<b>Gobji is now [Hobji]</b>

09:59.870 --> 10:02.620
<b>Gobrou is now [Ogrou]</b>

09:59.870 --> 10:02.950
<b>Gobkichi is now [Ogrekichi]</b>

09:59.870 --> 10:03.120
Gobkichi will be Ogrekichi, 
Gobji will be Hobji,

10:02.560 --> 10:06.500
<i>Well, I guess all that matters is 
that we can tell each other apart...</i>

10:02.620 --> 10:04.240
<b>Gobji is now [Hobji]</b>

10:02.620 --> 10:04.240
<b>Gobrou is now [Ogrou]</b>

10:02.950 --> 10:04.240
<b>Gobkichi is now [Ogrekichi]</b>

10:03.120 --> 10:05.450
and Gobrou is Ogrou!

10:04.240 --> 10:06.500
<b>Gobkichi is now [Ogrekichi]</b>

10:04.240 --> 10:06.500
<b>Gobji is now [Hobji]</b>

10:04.240 --> 10:06.500
<b>Gobrou is now [Ogrou]</b>

10:06.500 --> 10:11.510
1. Dhampir
2. Half-Spell Lord
2. Half-Earth Lord
2. Half-Bloody Lord
5. Ogres
6. Elves
7. Kobold Foot Soldiers
8. Kobolds
8. Hobgoblins
8. Humans
11. Goblins

10:07.360 --> 10:11.510
<i>This is how things look in terms 
of how powerful the different races are.</i>

10:12.350 --> 10:17.260
<i>Once their war with the humans starts, 
the elves will turn to us for help.</i>

10:17.820 --> 10:21.520
<i>And the more assets we have, the more
 tactical options will be at our disposal</i>

10:22.020 --> 10:26.020
<i>That being the case, I gave out 
a new set of communication earrings.</i>

10:26.470 --> 10:27.380
<i>Except...</i>

10:27.380 --> 10:29.700
We can't! We just can't put them on.

10:29.700 --> 10:35.030
It's extremely taboo for elves to
 decorate or let their ears be harmed.

10:35.740 --> 10:37.540
<i>So be it.</i>

10:38.160 --> 10:43.570
<i>I took my time relieving 
the elves of that pretense.</i>

10:45.210 --> 10:49.000
<i>With the addition of the kobolds and
 elves who now have earrings,</i>

10:49.480 --> 10:53.510
<i>there were many more participants 
in our daily training today.</i>

10:53.850 --> 10:57.090
<i>Later on, we had practical combat sparring.</i>

10:57.640 --> 10:59.620
<i>The opponents were some skeletons I created</i>

10:59.620 --> 11:02.890
<i>with the Summon Lower Undead 
ability I obtained the other day...</i>

11:06.680 --> 11:10.570
<i>with dark bones, instead of bleached ones, 
and heavy-duty equipment.</i>

11:11.540 --> 11:16.570
<i>The more armor a skeleton has, 
the higher quality it tends to be.</i>

11:18.070 --> 11:21.080
<i>Even the elves, with mythril weapons 
that are effective against undead,</i>

11:21.080 --> 11:22.830
<i>lost most of their sparring matches...</i>

11:22.830 --> 11:25.580
<i>But even the losers looked like 
they accepted the outcome.</i>

11:25.930 --> 11:30.090
<i>Building trust the natural way 
really works best, after all.</i>

11:30.590 --> 11:33.090
<b>Day 65</b>

11:33.090 --> 11:37.710
<b>Black Skeleton Axe-Wielder</b>

11:33.090 --> 11:39.260
<b>Zombie</b>

11:33.090 --> 11:39.340
<i>If I use less mana, I'm able to create 
regular skeletons, zombies, and other undead.</i>

11:36.380 --> 11:39.340
<b>Black Skeleton Mage</b>

11:39.340 --> 11:41.170
<i>I wondered what they tasted like...</i>

11:41.170 --> 11:44.880
<i>But it turns out you can't eat ghosts 
due to their lack of a physical form.</i>

11:44.880 --> 11:50.360
<i>The various undead made good opponents 
for practice and earning experience,</i>

11:50.700 --> 11:55.020
<i>but they're purified in just a few 
dozen seconds in daylight.</i>

11:55.020 --> 11:57.490
<i>Not being able to use them 
during the day is a drag.</i>

11:58.670 --> 12:02.490
<i>For now, I'm focusing on training 
the elves and kobolds.</i>

12:02.490 --> 12:10.000
Half-Lords - 3      Horses - 5
Ogres - 2             Bears - 3
Dhampirs - 1       Wolves - 8
Hobgoblins - 10  Wolf Leaders - 1
Hobgoblin Mages - 5
Hobgoblin Clerics - 2
Goblins - 30
Old Goblins - 8
Elves - 17
Humans - 5
Foot Soldier Kobolds - 1
Kobolds - 32
Old Kobolds - 3
Total: 136

12:03.000 --> 12:07.380
<i>After all, this village is currently bursting 
at the seams with over 100 members,</i>

12:07.380 --> 12:10.000
<i>and the kobolds are 
in a pretty low position.</i>

12:10.000 --> 12:13.000
<i>At this rate, things'll 
become hard for them...</i>

12:10.000 --> 12:13.000
Mind if I grab this spent zombie?

12:13.000 --> 12:16.850
<i>The only way to get past that is 
for them to work hard to get stronger.</i>

12:13.670 --> 12:16.850
Gobfu, isn't eating all that 
rotten meat bad for you?

12:16.850 --> 12:18.760
Rotten meat is the best meat.

12:19.260 --> 12:22.760
<b>Day 66</b>

12:19.660 --> 12:22.760
<i>Today, I headed to the caves 
where the kobolds live.</i>

12:23.160 --> 12:27.520
<i>After grabbing their belongings, 
I let Earthe take over.</i>

12:27.520 --> 12:29.360
Hell yeah!

12:30.130 --> 12:33.050
<i>That should ensure no more skeletons show up.</i>

12:33.050 --> 12:34.780
<i>And there was one other thing...</i>

12:35.730 --> 12:38.650
<i>I had the kobolds practice group hunting.</i>

12:38.990 --> 12:41.660
<i>The idea was to increase our 
number of black wolf familiars,</i>

12:42.340 --> 12:45.160
<i>but they proved to move 
far better than I expected,</i>

12:46.020 --> 12:48.960
<i>letting us collect a total of 20.</i>

12:49.950 --> 12:51.850
<i>There were no pack leaders in that number,</i>

12:51.850 --> 12:54.920
<i>but the additional wolves should 
prove useful as familiars.</i>

12:54.920 --> 12:58.920
<i>And along the way, we encountered a stamp boar, 
which are said to be as hard as stone.</i>

12:59.420 --> 13:01.840
How am I supposed to keep quiet 
after hearing that?!

13:12.560 --> 13:16.570
Sorry about that! I was actually 
trying to hold back!

13:13.490 --> 13:16.570
<i>It went into a pot and 
became stew that evening.</i>

13:17.520 --> 13:19.570
Awesome!

13:19.570 --> 13:25.580
<i>I found the upgraded form of the axe
I had damaged fighting the red bear.</i>

13:22.570 --> 13:24.900
So, in terms of improvements...

13:25.580 --> 13:34.080
<b>Pommel: Earth Spirit Stone Alloy
- Amplifies the effect of
earth-manipulation abilities.</b>

13:25.580 --> 13:34.080
<b>Axe Head: Water Spirit Stone Alloy
- Launches blades of water with swings.
-Has an improved edge to the actual blade.</b>

13:25.580 --> 13:34.080
<b>Fire Spirit Stone Alloy
- Fire will erupt from the points
struck by it.</b>

13:25.580 --> 13:34.080
<b>Lightning Spirit Stone Alloy
- Strikes at enemies from a distance
with a spear of lightning.
(Has a piercing effect)</b>

13:26.590 --> 13:29.510
<i>Nearly the entire thing had been modified</i>

13:29.510 --> 13:33.620
<i>with an alloy of spirit stone, iron, and mythril.</i>

13:34.080 --> 13:36.060
I worked hard on it!

13:36.060 --> 13:38.490
I'm genuinely impressed.

13:38.490 --> 13:41.090
Since when have you been able 
to make something like this?

13:41.090 --> 13:42.840
Well, you see...

13:44.020 --> 13:47.970
<i>By becoming experienced 
with the handling of spirit stone,</i>

13:47.970 --> 13:50.930
<i>the smith was able to rank up 
into an elemental smith.</i>

13:52.350 --> 13:57.860
<b>Day 67</b>

13:52.950 --> 13:57.860
<i>Another day, another kobold hunt. 
I found myself hunting stamp boars.</i>

14:01.860 --> 14:04.400
So, what did you want to talk about?

14:04.400 --> 14:07.120
Just... promise not to laugh, Ogrou.

14:08.270 --> 14:12.390
The truth is, I've always had 
a crush on Earthe...

14:13.370 --> 14:15.630
I know this might seem kinda sudden.

14:15.630 --> 14:18.420
Nah, I kinda figured.

14:19.450 --> 14:22.280
I mean, you're not exactly subtle, Ogrekichi.

14:22.280 --> 14:23.770
I-I'm not?

14:23.770 --> 14:24.630
Nah.

14:25.560 --> 14:30.060
Since becoming a half-earth lord, 
Earthe's gotten even prettier...

14:30.060 --> 14:34.140
A-And seeing her like that, 
I just can't hold back anymore...

14:34.770 --> 14:38.150
But I don't know what to say to her!

14:38.150 --> 14:41.720
C-C-Can you help me?! Please!

14:38.150 --> 14:41.720
<i>Right now, I've got this 
toasty feeling in my heart.</i>

14:41.720 --> 14:43.150
Ogrou!

14:43.870 --> 14:46.660
And so, tonight is the moment of truth!

14:46.660 --> 14:47.830
T-Tonight?!

14:47.830 --> 14:49.340
You'll be fine!

14:49.340 --> 14:52.160
And if not, the sooner you get it out 
of the way, the less damaging it'll be.

14:52.630 --> 14:56.670
Just let me know how it goes tomorrow.

15:02.460 --> 15:04.670
What's this all about, Kichi?

15:06.370 --> 15:08.180
I-I...

15:09.050 --> 15:13.120
I want us to be happy... together!

15:15.110 --> 15:17.940
The truth is, Kichi... I...

15:22.440 --> 15:24.950
<b>Day 68</b>

15:27.630 --> 15:30.680
<i>He nailed me good a few times.</i>

15:31.410 --> 15:34.050
I'm feeling really light on my feet today!

15:34.050 --> 15:36.350
And stronger than ever before!

15:36.760 --> 15:38.880
It's all thanks to you, Ogrou!

15:38.880 --> 15:41.680
Well, I'm glad I could help.

15:41.680 --> 15:44.290
<i>Looks like his confession
last night went well.</i>

15:44.880 --> 15:49.420
<i>Earthe had actually talked to
 Dhami about it yesterday...</i>

15:49.420 --> 15:53.310
<i>So, between the two of us, 
we set the stage for them.</i>

15:53.890 --> 15:58.760
<i>I'm just hoping Ogrekichi didn't get 
too excited and leave Earthe hobbled...</i>

15:58.760 --> 16:00.400
Ogrou!

16:00.770 --> 16:02.710
All done training?

16:02.710 --> 16:05.650
<i>Looks like I had nothing to worry about.</i>

16:07.030 --> 16:11.100
<i>He's been so strong and full of energy
 that I had a black skeleton take over.</i>

16:12.130 --> 16:13.410
Sorry about that!

16:13.410 --> 16:16.040
<i>After training, our usual 
quartet went out hunting.</i>

16:16.770 --> 16:19.620
<i>There were a lot of insect monsters 
I had never seen before,</i>

16:19.620 --> 16:22.630
<i>which made it great for gathering 
hard, armored materials.</i>

16:22.880 --> 16:29.380
<b>You Have Learned the Ability: [Molt] [Grow Elytron] [End Edge]
[Silent Kill] [Horn Blow] [Dissonance] [Parasitic]
[Jump Strength Up] [Resilience] [Exoskeleton Shell]
[Wrought Iron Shell Armor] [Rising Battle Instincts] [Weakness to Cold]</b>

16:23.110 --> 16:25.590
<i>Molt. Grow Elytron. End Edge. Silent Kill. 
Horn Blow. Dissonance. Parasitic.</i>

16:25.590 --> 16:27.840
<i>Jump Strength Up. Resilience. Exoskeleton 
Shell. Wrought Iron Shell Armor.</i>

16:27.840 --> 16:29.340
<i>Rising Battle Instincts. Weakness to Cold.</i>

16:29.740 --> 16:32.020
<i>An exoskeleton, huh?</i>

16:32.740 --> 16:34.390
<i>Let's try it out.</i>

16:38.190 --> 16:40.900
<i>I look like one of those 
transforming superheroes...</i>

16:43.180 --> 16:44.510
<i>It's as durable as you'd expect,</i>

16:44.510 --> 16:47.760
<i>and it has the ability to repair itself 
and disperse impacts as well.</i>

16:48.400 --> 16:51.730
Not sure I like how 
conspicuous it is, though.

16:51.730 --> 16:54.770
You think? I think it looks cool.

16:54.770 --> 16:57.660
Besides, I like my usual outfit...

16:59.970 --> 17:04.360
<i>Looks like my normal clothes 
were used to create the exoskeleton.</i>

17:04.360 --> 17:08.420
<i>Man, I really liked that outfit. 
It was made from the red bear's pelt...</i>

17:08.420 --> 17:10.930
<b>Ability [Exoskeleton Shell]
<1> [Red Bear Beast King's Prestige]
has been registered.</b>

17:10.930 --> 17:13.430
<b>>You can register four
additional forms.
Which will you equip?</b>

17:13.430 --> 17:17.930
<i>I see. I kinda wanna register forms 
for aerial and sea battles, too...</i>

17:20.440 --> 17:21.930
He can fly!

17:20.440 --> 17:24.030
<i>With Grow Elytron, 
I can sprout insect wings.</i>

17:21.930 --> 17:23.440
That's awesome, Ogrou!

17:24.030 --> 17:27.440
<i>It's not easy, though. 
Gonna need to practice.</i>

17:27.440 --> 17:28.830
He fell!

17:28.830 --> 17:30.450
Nice one, Ogrou!

17:30.860 --> 17:34.730
<i>I took the stamp boar meat back, 
and we all ate it together.</i>

17:34.730 --> 17:37.330
<i>The day turned out to be really productive.</i>

17:37.580 --> 17:39.490
<b>You Have Learned the Ability: [Rampage]</b>

17:37.580 --> 17:40.580
<i>Rampage. Tail Attack.</i>

17:39.490 --> 17:40.580
<b>You Have Learned the Ability: [Tail Attack]</b>

17:41.160 --> 17:44.670
<b>Day 69</b>

17:42.330 --> 17:44.670
<i>How long has it been since it last rained?</i>

17:45.490 --> 17:49.170
<i>Oh, well. Guess I'll spend the day crafting.</i>

17:49.170 --> 17:52.180
Oh, Ogrou! Come on and spar with me!

17:52.930 --> 17:56.080
<i>The short-haired redhead 
has been making steady progress,</i>

17:56.080 --> 17:58.920
<i>which has led her to ask for training lately.</i>

17:59.700 --> 18:03.420
<i>She's gone from reminding me 
of a puppy or a smaller dog</i>

18:03.790 --> 18:06.200
<i>to feeling more like a Doberman.</i>

18:06.910 --> 18:10.690
<i>And so I started the morning sparring with her.</i>

18:11.130 --> 18:14.700
<i>After working up a sweat, 
I headed to the blacksmith.</i>

18:15.100 --> 18:20.520
<i>Lately, she's been visiting the elves and
 discussing new weapon ideas with them.</i>

18:16.370 --> 18:20.520
Hey, more mythril! That'll be a big help.

18:21.200 --> 18:24.020
Oh, no, it's all part of our studies.

18:21.880 --> 18:25.710
<i>By the way, their names are Kirue and Arue.</i>

18:26.450 --> 18:30.050
<i>Mythril has to be turned into an 
amalgam before being processed.</i>

18:30.050 --> 18:34.720
<i>The spirit stone alloy used in my 
halberd is also a type of amalgam.</i>

18:35.210 --> 18:39.220
<i>She's working on developing 
a repeating crossbow,</i>

18:40.930 --> 18:44.810
<i>and things are looking so good that 
I asked her to move on to manufacturing.</i>

18:44.810 --> 18:47.190
Could you use this to whip me up 
another weapon?

18:45.340 --> 18:47.810
<i>I also provided her with some more amalgam.</i>

18:47.190 --> 18:48.520
I'm counting on you.

18:49.190 --> 18:51.570
I'll take care of it!

18:51.570 --> 18:53.880
<i>That evening, I helped out our chef sisters.</i>

18:53.880 --> 18:56.080
Can I get a soup plate?

18:54.770 --> 18:59.560
<i>It turns out, they've both obtained 
a new job too: head cook.</i>

18:56.810 --> 18:58.800
How's that food arrangement going?

18:59.880 --> 19:03.100
<i>After dinner, I had them try to 
recreate dishes from my past life.</i>

19:01.030 --> 19:03.710
Wow! It's so crunchy!

19:03.710 --> 19:05.080
<i>Like potato chips and such.</i>

19:05.080 --> 19:09.750
I've never heard of most of these dishes, 
but they're really interesting!

19:09.750 --> 19:12.340
The more complex they are, 
the more we can learn!

19:12.770 --> 19:17.340
<i>After that, I had a meeting with the alchemist 
about manufacturing magical items.</i>

19:17.880 --> 19:22.050
The black skeleton bones 
turned out to be very handy.

19:22.610 --> 19:27.410
This bone nail has the ability to freeze 
whoever's struck with it in place.

19:27.850 --> 19:32.860
It's the first thing I've produced 
since becoming an item creator.

19:33.310 --> 19:36.860
Think of it as me, and take good care of it.

19:38.070 --> 19:42.040
<i>Her unusually playful attitude got to me.</i>

19:42.040 --> 19:43.240
<i>And then...</i>

19:43.240 --> 19:46.750
There you go, sneaking around again!

19:46.750 --> 19:48.540
<i>As for what happened next...</i>

19:50.280 --> 19:51.750
<i>I won't elaborate.</i>

19:52.250 --> 19:54.760
<b>Day 70</b>

19:52.610 --> 19:54.760
Ogrou! Come quick!

19:55.600 --> 19:58.260
Th-There are some strange elves 
at the entrance!

20:01.150 --> 20:05.270
We're here on behalf 
of your friend, our chief.

20:05.630 --> 20:08.590
<i>They passed by their old 
comrades on the way in, but...</i>

20:09.680 --> 20:14.780
<i>The earrings had a disguise effect 
that made them appear to be dark elves.</i>

20:15.760 --> 20:20.930
The human army is finally 
advancing on the Kudel Woods,

20:21.600 --> 20:25.450
with a large force that we'll 
be unable to repel on our own.

20:25.810 --> 20:29.290
I've come here to secure your assistance.

20:29.650 --> 20:33.720
Well, whatever happened to your elite force?

20:33.720 --> 20:37.320
W-We've been told to consider them dead.

20:37.750 --> 20:39.300
I-I see...

20:39.740 --> 20:44.340
Price is of no concern. Our chief wants 
the enemy to be eliminated completely.

20:45.010 --> 20:50.060
However, the contract will be considered 
void in the event of a retreat.

20:50.060 --> 20:54.250
I appreciate the warning and
 humbly accept the job.

20:54.250 --> 20:56.820
But we're making our own moves.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.150
Give this to your chief.

20:59.820 --> 21:02.580
It will let him communicate with us.

21:02.930 --> 21:04.510
I'll see to it.

21:05.130 --> 21:06.760
If you'll excuse me.

21:06.760 --> 21:09.830
<i>Yes, information is always a crucial weapon.</i>

21:10.470 --> 21:13.840
<i>I've got my creations 
canvassing the woods already.</i>

21:14.420 --> 21:19.490
"If you want peace, prepare for war," huh?

21:20.900 --> 21:22.820
Gather the others.

21:24.030 --> 21:26.850
It's time to put everything 
we've been working on to use.

21:26.850 --> 21:29.610
Starting today, we're a mercenary company!

21:29.610 --> 21:31.320
Wh-What do you mean?

21:31.320 --> 21:34.860
Put simply, we're a
 professional force of fighters.

21:36.040 --> 21:37.860
That sounds rad!

21:37.860 --> 21:40.100
And what'll we be called?

21:41.270 --> 21:42.780
Parabellum.

21:44.200 --> 21:48.120
And now, Parabellum Mercenary 
Company, prepare for battle!

21:50.080 --> 21:51.120
Parabellum!

21:51.710 --> 21:55.130
Parabellum! Parabellum!

21:55.130 --> 21:56.040
Parabellum!

21:56.040 --> 21:59.960
<i>Now... it's time for our first big job.</i>

23:29.970 --> 23:40.820
<b>Next Time:</b>
